/-- **Sharpness, per-rank**: at exponent `1 - 31558/10^8` the per-rank inequality `tally / 2^a < m^z`
fails for every table of `K` copies of `G` units and `p` idle roles (`tally = (K G W + p) m - K G D`). -/
